        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMGR44-LTN, Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Lewiston Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Maguire Handleset with Lewiston Knob has a oval shape that is one of the most desired silhouettes of traditional door hardware for its classic appeal and its timelessness. The Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Lewiston Knob will adjust to fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from popular finish colors for your front door lock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Expressions Maguire Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2-1/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMGR44-LTN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262434\"><b>Yale YMGR44-LTN Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
