                "title": "Maguire Handleset with Lewiston Knob",
                "description": "The Maguire Handleset with Lewiston Knob has a oval shape that is one of the most desired silhouettes of traditional door hardware for its classic appeal and its timelessness. The Maguire Entry Door Handleset with Lewiston Knob will adjust to fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from popular finish colors for your front door lock.",
